  "$comment": "Visual parity (SPEC \u00a714). An SDK must draw every icon in `icons` from contract.json#design.icons, every mark variant from design.jotMark, and render every component in `components` from design.ui (with each listed part) plus design.tokens \u2014 never stock platform controls. Every token name referenced anywhere in design.ui must exist in exactly one design.tokens group.",
